    demo: 0
    priority: 0
    volume: 1
    cooldown: 0
    assisted: 0
    controllerTarget: 
    rightHand: 0
    controllerAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    transcript: If both the reserve and your can run out before the plant has enough
      water, we'll need to try again.
    instruction: Make the water last.
    instructionDetail: If the can and reserve run out early, try again.
    steps: []
